# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

overflow is project
overflow purpose "Double a number until Int64 overflows, so the program traps; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
overflow target console
overflow version "0.1.0"
overflow language refined 1
overflow standardLibrary 1
overflow allows write console.stdout none
overflow requires none
overflow includesModule overflow
overflow entry overflow.main
